			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_592940297913310676">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c592940297913281807">UrbanNoodles</a></b>:</div>We aren't your diary, Luddite. We don't really care if you have this on your ignore list. You telling us it is being ignored by you is pure attention seeking behavior.<br><br>Honestly, who cares if AI was used in literally any capacity. What matters is whether the game is good or not. I could not care less that some random artist, developer, translator, or whatever other profession you want to name did not get paid for work they were never hired or asked to do in the first place. All that matters is the state of the game on release, and how the devs handle fixing any issues after release. <br><br>If AI actually makes the game worse, criticize the result. Simply saying &quot;AI was used&quot; tells me nothing about whether the game is good or not. </blockquote>YES.<br>Ya know...for gamers this used to be the one and only real standard...is it fun....now there's so many reasons to decide the game is ♥♥♥♥♥ 6 months out			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
									<div></div>
				
				
